grebački RIZ i TRS, sarajevski UNIS, ljubljanski IMP i Ei Niš. Velika većina tih kalkulatora bila je napravljena po uvoznoj licenci, a nitko nije dosegao kvalitetu i važnost kakvu je imao Digitron. </div><div class="qr-and-instructions"><div class="qr-container"><img src="/assets/images/final/64da230b62786b295daa9ab5_image.png" loading="lazy" alt="QR kod za AR iskustvo proširene stvarnosti" class="image qr"/><div class="text-block-3">Skeniraj kod mobitelom i uperi kameru u sliku da pokreneš AR.</div></div></div></div><div data-hero-variant="desktop" class="heroheader05_image-wrapper"><div class="image-group"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/64de3c198a8fc012748690e2_Domaci-proizvodjaci-3.png" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" height="" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 559.169921875px, 56vw" alt="Abak - antički kalkulator" data-srcset="/assets/images/final/64de3c198a8fc012748690e2_Domaci-proizvodjaci-3-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/64de3c198a8fc012748690e2_Domaci-proizvodjaci-3.png 800w" class="heroheader05_image hero-image-size image-size-large"/><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/64da24687196d1736389be23_Pozadina%20za%20sliku.svg" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="image background" class="image-background image-background-opacity"/><div class="w-layout-hflex ar-and-copyright"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/64db374e19c92a97dd217809_AR%20ikona%20-%20s.png" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="irene stvarnosti" class="image-2"/><div class="text-copyright-or-title">Tradicionalni kineski abacus</div></div></div><div class="qr-and-instructions tablet"><div class="qr-container"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/64da230b62786b295daa9ab5_image.png" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="QR kod za AR iskustvo proširene stvarnosti" class="image qr"/><div class="text-block-3">Skeniraj kod mobitelom i uperi kameru u sliku da pokreneš AR.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></header><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component"><div class="layout58_image-wrapper"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/64ff16f82f581d333f7617eb_Pitagora%202000.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 407.63671875px, 41vw" width="753" alt="image background" srcset="/assets/images/final/64ff16f82f581d333f7617eb_Pitagora%202000-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/64ff16f82f581d333f7617eb_Pitagora%202000.png 700w" class="featured-image-background-left image-opacity"/><img src="/assets/images/final/64ff16f82f581d333f7617eb_Pitagora%202000.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/64ff16f82f581d333f7617eb_Pitagora%202000-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/64ff16f82f581d333f7617eb_Pitagora%202000.png 700w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 96vw, (max-width: 991px) 92vw, 41vw" class="featured-image image-size-no-background"/></div></div><div id="w-node-a2d11aa4-922b-74bb-1904-5977e08ff1d3-f0a9b5a7" class="layout58_content"><div class="text-size-large-2">Zagrebački inženjer Mišo Rabatić osmislio je školsko pomagalo Pitagora 2000, nagrađeno broncom na EXPO-u 1988. koje je istovremeno bilo i šestar, ravnalo, kutomjer, kompas, kalkulator i još štošta.</div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component image-right"><div id="w-node-e95d7e74-057e-f0f8-78e3-c1fe4b9c37d5-f0a9b5a7" class="layout58_content"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xsmall"><h3 class="heading-medium hide-heading3">TRS<br/></h3></div><div class="text-size-large-2">Tvornica računalnih strojeva Zagreb osnovana je 1948. godine, a proizvodila je kalkulatore, računske strojeve, mjerne instrumente za medicinu, pisače i slično.</div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="layout58_image-wrapper"><h3 class="heading-medium heading-duplicated">TRS<br/></h3><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/64da24687196d1736389be23_Pozadina%20za%20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left image-opacity"/><img src="/assets/images/final/extra/logo%20trs.png" loading="lazy" alt="TRS logo" class="featured-image image-size-no-background image-logo-mobile-size scroll-reveal-image"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component"><div class="layout58_image-wrapper"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/64da24687196d1736389be23_Pozadina%20za%20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left image-opacity"/><img src="/assets/images/final/64de1f0d4c469366b6d32f82_TRS%20racunar.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/64de1f0d4c469366b6d32f82_TRS%20racunar-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/64de1f0d4c469366b6d32f82_TRS%20racunar.png 700w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 96vw, (max-width: 991px) 92vw, 41vw" class="featured-image image-size-no-background"/></div></div><div id="w-node-_0a8b659d-8d85-f8fb-eb32-23ddf0c9798d-f0a9b5a7" class="layout58_content"><div class="text-size-large-2">Najpoznatiji TRS-ov kalkulator je mehanički Calcorex Model 403 kojega je, jer se radilo o češko licenci, redizajnirao prvi diplomirani industrijski dizajner u Jugoslaviji Davor Grünwald čija je suradnja s TRS-om ostala zapamćena kao vrlo kvalitetna.</div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component image-right"><div id="w-node-a2d11aa4-922b-74bb-1904-5977e08ff1ec-f0a9b5a7" class="layout58_content"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xsmall"><h3 class="heading-medium hide-heading3">RIZ<br/></h3></div><div class="text-size-large-2">Radio Industrija Zagreb osnovana je 1948. s ciljem proizvodnje odašiljača za radiodifuziju, no vrlo brzo počeli su proizvoditi i televizore, zvučnike te elektroničke komponente. RIZ-ov izlet na tržište džepnih kalkulatora bio je kratak, a proizvedeno je svega pet ili šest modela u periodu od 1975. do 1976. godine. <br/></div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="layout58_image-wrapper"><h3 class="heading-medium heading-duplicated">RIZ<br/></h3><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/64da24687196d1736389be23_Pozadina%20za%20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left image-opacity"/><img src="/assets/images/final/extra/logo%20riz.png" loading="lazy" alt="RIZ logo" class="featured-image image-size-no-background image-logo-mobile-size scroll-reveal-image"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component"><div class="layout58_image-wrapper"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/64da24687196d1736389be23_Pozadina%20za%20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left image-opacity"/><img src="/assets/images/final/64de1f8e01fef1dd6653a799_07-RIZ-naljepnice---s.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/64de1f8e01fef1dd6653a799_07-RIZ-naljepnice---s-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/64de1f8e01fef1dd6653a799_07-RIZ-naljepnice---s.png 700w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 96vw, (max-width: 991px) 92vw, 41vw" class="featured-image image-size-no-background"/></div></div><div id="w-node-_0c7182cb-077f-cc21-e3a3-9b4288e46a74-f0a9b5a7" class="layout58_content"><div class="text-size-large-2">Kako je početkom 1990-ih, prilikom privatizacije tvrtke, uništena prethodna dokumentacija, teško je sa sigurnošću tvrditi, ali čini se da su svi RIZ-ovi kalkulatori rađeni po uvoznim licencama.</div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>

